<Base title="Corrections and challenges"><div class="page-heading"><span class="kicker">ACCOUNTABILITY LOG</span><h1>Corrections & challenges</h1><p>Publisher corrections and challenges to our records belong in an auditable log with source links and dates.</p></div><div class="empty panel" style="margin-top:30px"><strong>No corrections recorded</strong><p>No correction or challenge has been added to the current file. This does not mean no publisher correction exists. See the original source page for its latest state.</p></div><div class="prose"><h2>What we change</h2><p>We update incorrect metadata, add missing context, and revise classifications when evidence warrants it. An entry should retain the original and updated dates, the source of the change, and a record of the review.</p></div></Base>
